  "description": "Official .NET SDK for Guardhouse Cloud. Provides client credentials flow, JWT signature validation (RFC 7515), token introspection (RFC 7662), and typed clients for the external Guardhouse system API. Includes JWKS caching with lazy refresh, configurable validation rules, and HTTP resilience with Polly. Supports .NET 6.0 through .NET 10.0.",
