  "releaseNotes": "1.0.2 - system API alignment and release readiness update.\n\n            Changes:\n            - Align SDK system API clients with the external Users, Roles, and Permissions endpoints\n            - Remove obsolete SDK-only user role, permission, and privacy client surfaces\n            - Add typed roles and permissions clients plus updated request/response models\n            - Refresh README and add dedicated system API documentation for NuGet consumers",
